---
import Mascot from '../components/Mascot.astro';
import pkg from '../../../packages/fnclaude/package.json';
import '../styles/landing.css';

// The header version is the umbrella package's, read at build time so a
// release bump propagates without anyone editing this page.
const { version } = pkg;
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>fnclaude</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Session control for Claude Code: move a running session to another repository, or open a sibling beside it, each starting from a written continuity summary."
    />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      rel="stylesheet"
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,700;0,800;1,400&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;1,400&display=swap"
    />
  </head>

  <body>
    <header class="session-head wrap">
      <Mascot class="rhombus" />

      <div class="head-lines">
        <h1 class="head-name">fnclaude<span class="ver">v{version}</span></h1>
        <div class="head-meta">
          Session control for Claude Code &middot; <span class="on">fnc</span> for short
        </div>
        <div class="head-meta">~/src/fnclaude@fnclaude</div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero wrap">
        <h1>Change projects without <em>losing the thread.</em></h1>

        <p>
          Claude Code is rooted in one directory. <span class="lit">fnclaude</span> makes
          that a thing you can move. Hand the session to another repo, or open a sibling
          beside it &mdash; each one starts from a written continuity summary instead of a
          cold context.
        </p>

        <div class="prompt">
          <span class="caret" aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
          <code>mise use -g npm:@fnclaude/cli</code>
          <span class="cursor" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </div>

        <p class="hint">
          Then <kbd>fnc</kbd> anywhere &mdash; or <kbd>fnc &lt;repo&gt;</kbd> to start somewhere
          specific.
        </p>

        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/getting-started/">Get Started</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://github.com/fnclaude/fnclaude">GitHub</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="transcript wrap">
        <h2 class="section-label">What it adds to a session</h2>

        <dl class="calls">
          <div class="call">
            <dt>fnc_switch_project</dt>
            <dd>
              Replaces this session with one rooted in another repo. Writes the handoff
              first, so the new session opens knowing what it&rsquo;s there for.
            </dd>
          </div>

          <div class="call">
            <dt>fnc_spawn_session</dt>
            <dd>
              Keeps this session running and opens a sibling in a new window. Two tracks in
              parallel, neither waiting on the other.
            </dd>
          </div>

          <div class="call">
            <dt>Repo references, resolved</dt>
            <dd>
              <code>arch-setup</code>, <code>name@owner</code>, <code>owner/name</code>, a
              URL, or a path. Searches your GitHub orgs and clones it if it has to.
              <span class="note">You type the short name. It finds the thing.</span>
            </dd>
          </div>

          <div class="call">
            <dt>Worktrees with a <code>+</code></dt>
            <dd>
              <code>fnc arch-setup+fix-lid-sync</code> resolves the base repo and adds a
              worktree alongside it, branched and ready.
            </dd>
          </div>

          <div class="call">
            <dt>get_usage</dt>
            <dd>
              Session cost, per-model token breakdown, and live context size &mdash; read
              from data fnclaude already holds. No extra API calls to ask.
            </dd>
          </div>

          <div class="call">
            <dt>The noop landing zone</dt>
            <dd>
              Start nowhere. <code>fnc</code> with no argument drops you in a router that
              reads the ask and sends it to the repo it belongs in.
            </dd>
          </div>
        </dl>

        <div class="outro">
          <span>MIT licensed</span>
          <span>Linux and macOS</span>
          <a href="/installation/">Installation</a>
          <a href="/reference/tools/">Tool reference</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="statusbar">
      <div class="status-left">
        <span class="perm"
          >&#9656;&#9656; bypass permissions on <span class="muted">(shift+tab to cycle)</span
          ></span
        >
      </div>

      <div class="status-right">
        <div class="burndowns" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="burn">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 44 16"
              ><g fill="#6d6d6d">
                <rect x="2" y="3" width="1" height="1" /><rect x="7" y="4" width="1" height="1" />
                <rect x="12" y="6" width="1" height="1" /><rect x="17" y="7" width="1" height="1" />
                <rect x="22" y="9" width="1" height="1" /><rect
                  x="27"
                  y="10"
                  width="1"
                  height="1"
                />
                <rect x="32" y="12" width="1" height="1" /><rect
                  x="37"
                  y="13"
                  width="1"
                  height="1"
                />
              </g></svg
            >
            <span>5h</span>
          </div>
          <div class="burn">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 44 16">
              <rect x="2" y="2" width="1" height="1" fill="#c9b458" />
              <g fill="#6d6d6d">
                <rect x="7" y="4" width="1" height="1" /><rect x="12" y="5" width="1" height="1" />
                <rect x="17" y="7" width="1" height="1" /><rect x="22" y="8" width="1" height="1" />
                <rect x="27" y="10" width="1" height="1" /><rect
                  x="32"
                  y="11"
                  width="1"
                  height="1"
                />
                <rect x="37" y="13" width="1" height="1" />
              </g>
            </svg>
            <span>7d</span>
          </div>
          <div class="burn">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 44 16">
              <rect x="2" y="3" width="1" height="1" fill="#b7bdf7" />
              <g fill="#6d6d6d">
                <rect x="7" y="5" width="1" height="1" /><rect x="12" y="6" width="1" height="1" />
                <rect x="17" y="8" width="1" height="1" /><rect x="22" y="9" width="1" height="1" />
                <rect x="27" y="11" width="1" height="1" /><rect
                  x="32"
                  y="12"
                  width="1"
                  height="1"
                />
                <rect x="37" y="13" width="1" height="1" />
              </g>
            </svg>
            <span>opus</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <span class="model">Opus 5 <span class="eff">high</span></span>
        <span class="rc">/rc</span>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
